#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:6
msgid "Setting up Haply Teleoperation"
msgstr "设置 Haply 远程操作"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Haply Devices`_ provides haptic devices that enable intuitive robot "
"teleoperation with directional force feedback. The Haply Inverse3 paired "
"with the VerseGrip creates an end-effector control system with force "
"feedback capabilities."
msgstr ""
"`Haply Devices`_ 提供触觉设备，可实现具有定向力反馈的直观机器人远程操作。Haply Inverse3 与 VerseGrip "
"配对，创建了一个具有力反馈功能的末端执行器控制系统。"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:14
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports Haply devices for teleoperation workflows that require "
"precise spatial control with haptic feedback. This enables operators to feel"
" contact forces during manipulation tasks, improving control quality and "
"task performance."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持 Haply "
"设备用于需要精确空间控制和触觉反馈的远程操作工作流程。这使操作员能够在操作任务期间感受接触力，从而提高控制质量和任务性能。"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:18
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to set up and use Haply devices with Isaac Lab for "
"robot teleoperation."
msgstr "本指南介绍如何设置和使用 Haply 设备与 Isaac Lab 进行机器人远程操作。"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:24
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:26
msgid "Using Haply with Isaac Lab involves the following components:"
msgstr "使用 Haply 与 Isaac Lab 涉及以下组件:"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Isaac Lab** simulates the robot environment and streams contact forces "
"back to the operator"
msgstr "**Isaac Lab** 模拟机器人环境并将接触力流式传输回操作员"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Haply Inverse3** provides 3-DOF position tracking and force feedback in "
"the operator's workspace"
msgstr "**Haply Inverse3** 在操作员的工作空间中提供 3 自由度位置跟踪和力反馈"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Haply VerseGrip** adds orientation sensing and button inputs for gripper "
"control"
msgstr "**Haply VerseGrip** 添加方向感知和用于夹爪控制的按钮输入"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Haply SDK** manages WebSocket communication between Isaac Lab and the "
"Haply hardware"
msgstr "**Haply SDK** 管理 Isaac Lab 和 Haply 硬件之间的 WebSocket 通信"

