msgstr "安装"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:85
msgid "1. Install Isaac Lab"
msgstr "1. 安装 Isaac Lab"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:87
msgid ""
"Follow the Isaac Lab :ref:`installation guide <isaaclab-installation-root>` "
"to set up your environment."
msgstr "遵循 Isaac Lab :ref:`安装指南 <isaaclab-installation-root>` 设置您的环境。"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:89
msgid ""
"The ``websockets`` dependency is automatically included in Isaac Lab's "
"requirements."
msgstr "``websockets`` 依赖项自动包含在 Isaac Lab 的要求中。"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:92
msgid "2. Install Haply SDK"
msgstr "2. 安装 Haply SDK"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:94
msgid ""
"Download the Haply SDK from the `Haply Devices`_ website. Install the SDK "
"software and configure the devices."
msgstr "从 `Haply Devices`_ 网站下载 Haply SDK。安装 SDK 软件并配置设备。"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:98
msgid "3. Verify Installation"
msgstr "3. 验证安装"

