#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:197
msgid ""
"**Workspace Mapping**: Haply workspace is mapped to robot reachable space "
"with safety limits"
msgstr "**工作空间映射**: Haply 工作空间映射到具有安全限制的机器人可达空间"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:198
msgid ""
"**Inverse Kinematics**: Inverse Kinematics (IK) computes joint positions for"
" desired end-effector pose"
msgstr "**逆运动学**: 逆运动学（IK）计算所需末端执行器姿态的关节位置"

#: source/how-to/haply_teleoperation.rst:199
msgid ""
"**Force Feedback**: Contact forces from end-effector sensors are sent to "
"Inverse3 for haptic feedback"
msgstr "**力反馈**: 来自末端执行器传感器的接触力被发送到 Inverse3 以提供触觉反馈"

